  "title": "Ham with Red Eye Gravy",
  "description": "Red-eye gravy is a traditional Southern gravy made with black coffee and roast ham pan drippings for a delicious sweet-smoky flavor combination.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
